OL,3,GNEWSAPair sentenced over anti-migrant
OL,4,Aprotest violence
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwo men who admitted violent disorder
OL,7,Fat an anti-migrant protest have been
OL,8,Fgiven suspended prison sentences.
OL,10,FJustin Dixon and Deano Ryan were
OL,11,Finvolved in a demonstration in Eastney,
OL,12,FPortsmouth, on 6 September, after about
OL,13,F120 migrants who had crossed the
OL,14,FEnglish Channel in a small boat were
OL,15,Fbrought to shore.
OL,17,FDixon, 50, was recorded on video
OL,18,Fpushing a large metal gate towards
OL,19,Fpolice, while Ryan, 22, was filmed
OL,20,Fappearing to throw stones.
OL,23,APub: 08-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,337,330,200,160,0,100
