OL,3,GNEWSAPair sentenced over anti-migrant
OL,4,Aprotest violence
OL,5,
OL,6,FJudge Daniel Sawyer, sitting at
OL,7,FPortsmouth Crown Court, said both men
OL,8,Fhad played a limited role in the
OL,9,Fdisorder, but told Dixon he had come
OL,10,Fwithin "a hair's breadth of going to
OL,11,Fprison".
